  tips:["ابدأ بتحية: Hi + الاسم، وسؤال How are you?","احكي اللي حصل بالترتيب: First, Then, After that","استعمل الماضي البسيط (arrived, went) والماضي المستمر للحدث الطويل (was helping)","اختم بسؤال وتحية: How was your week? Write soon!"],
  txt:"Hi Sara,\n\nHow are you? I had a really busy day yesterday!\n\nI arrived at the branch at eight, and there was already a long queue. At ten, while I was helping a customer, the system stopped for forty minutes, so we wrote all the requests on paper. Some customers were angry, but our manager spoke to them calmly. After that, everything went well, and we finished all the work before three.\n\nIn the evening, I was very tired, so I went to bed early.\n\nHow was your week? Write soon!\nMona",
